Accepted Carelessly and Knowingly Act of 2025 or the SEND THEM BACK Act of 2025</strong></p><p>This bill subjects non-U.S. nationals (<em>aliens</em> under federal law) who illegally entered the United States on or after January 20, 2021, to expedited removal (i.e., removal without further hearing or review). This applies even if such an individual indicated an intention to apply for asylum or expressed a fear of persecution. The bill does not apply to an individual serving in the Armed Forces as of January 1, 2025.</p>","updateDate":"2025-02-19T20:30:44Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"SEND THEM BACK Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-02-19T20:30:57Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-02-19T20:30:57Z"}
